# CRM-GATES — App Reference

An **Arabic-first internal CRM / sales ops** system. UI is RTL (Cairo font, `lang="ar"`, `dir="rtl"`). All copy/nav labels are in Arabic.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | **Next.js 16.2.4** — App Router, `next dev --webpack` |
| React | 19.2.4 |
| Database | **MySQL** via **Prisma 6.19** |
| Auth | **NextAuth v5** (credentials + JWT, 30-day sessions) |
| UI | **Tailwind CSS 4** + **shadcn-style** primitives (`components/ui/`) |
| Forms | `react-hook-form` + `zod` |
| Other | `bcryptjs`, `date-fns`, `xlsx`, `sonner`, `framer-motion`, `lucide-react` |

> Always read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing Next.js code — this version has breaking changes.

---

## Directory Map

```
app/                  # App Router — pages, layouts, API routes, server actions
