## API Routes (`app/api/`)

| Route | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `auth/[...nextauth]` | NextAuth handler |
| `import/clients`, `clients-xlsx`, `clients-mapped`, `report-xlsx`, `mapped-rows` | Excel import flows |
| `export/excel`, `export/pdf` | Export handlers |
| `sales-for-filter` | Sales user list for report filters |
| `recommendations/from-client-report`, `recommendations/[id]` | Management recommendations |
| `clients/[id]/row-style` | Per-user report row color |
| `warming/[clientId]` | Warming tool state |
| `audit-log` | Audit log queries |
| `backup/export`, `backup/import` | DB backup (admin only) |

