## Server Actions (`app/actions/`)

`clients.ts`, `client-update.ts`, `delete-client.ts`, `transfer-client.ts`, `interactions.ts`, `recommendations.ts`, `report-client-patch.ts`, `report-b-transitions.ts`, `warming-actions.ts`, `alerts.ts`, `auth.ts`, `admin-user-lifecycle.ts`, `admin-user-password.ts`, `admin-fields.ts`, `classifications-admin.ts`, `register-user.ts`

All actions check `getSessionUser()` / role as needed before mutating.

---

## Conventions

- **Data access layer**: always use `lib/data/*` for queries, not bare Prisma calls in pages.
- **Role gating in nav**: `adminOnly` / `managerPlus` flags in `crm-nav.tsx` and `lib/layout/crm-header-config.ts`.
- **`force-dynamic`**: set on `(crm)/layout.tsx`, dashboard, and register to prevent stale data.
- **Arabic normalization**: `lib/import/normalize-arabic-text.ts` used during Excel imports.
- **Prisma singleton**: import from `lib/prisma.ts`, never instantiate `PrismaClient` directly.
- **`resolveSessionDbUserId`**: use instead of raw `session.user.id` to handle reseed ID drift.
